.TH GHOSTLINK 1 "December 2025" "ghostlink 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ghostlink \- Autonomous AI Orchestration Framework
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ghostlink
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fICOMMAND\fR [\fIARGS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
GhostLink is a completely local, sovereign AI orchestration system with symbolic reasoning,
hardware binding, and autonomous operation capabilities. It requires no external dependencies
and runs entirely on local hardware.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show Link's current status, including active tasks and system metrics.
.TP
.B start [--daemon]
Start Link's autonomous operation. Use --daemon to run in background.
.TP
.B stop
Stop Link's operation and clean up resources.
.TP
.B reset
Reset Link's memory and learned preferences.
.TP
.B version
Display version and build information.
.TP
.B help, -h, --help
Show command help message.
.SS Task Management
.TP
.B task list
List all tasks with status and priority.
.TP
.B task add \fIDESCRIPTION\fR
Add a new task with optional priority flag.
.TP
.B task status \fIID\fR
Show detailed status of a specific task.
.TP
.B task complete \fIID\fR
Mark a task as complete.
.SS Git Operations
.TP
.B git status
Show repository status and pending changes.
.TP
.B git sync
Sync with remote repository (pull + push).
.TP
.B git pull
Pull latest changes from remote.
.TP
.B git abort
Abort any ongoing merge operations.
.SS Diagnostics
.TP
.B diagnostics health
Run comprehensive health check on all systems.
.TP
.B diagnostics errors
Display recent error logs and warnings.
.TP
.B diagnostics fix-common
Automatically fix common configuration issues.
.TP
.B diagnostics monitor
Continuously monitor system (60 seconds).
.TP
.B diagnostics sysinfo
Display detailed system information.
.SS Context Management
.TP
.B context list
List all context variables and values.
.TP
.B context set \fIKEY VALUE\fR
Set a context variable.
.TP
.B context get \fIKEY\fR
Retrieve a context variable value.
.SS Learning & Preferences
.TP
.B learn list
Show all learned preferences.
.TP
.B learn add \fIKEY VALUE\fR
Add or update a learning preference.
.TP
.B history
Display execution history and logs.
.SS System Integration
.TP
.B install
Install GhostLink to system paths (requires sudo).
.TP
.B uninstall
Remove GhostLink from system paths (requires sudo).
.TP
.B daemon start
Start GhostLink as background daemon.
.TP
.B daemon stop
Stop the running GhostLink daemon.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --config \fIFILE\fR
Use custom configuration file instead of default.
.TP
.B --data-dir \fIDIR\fR
Override default data storage directory.
.TP
.B --log-dir \fIDIR\fR
Override default log directory.
.TP
.B --verbose
Increase verbosity of output.
.TP
.B --quiet
Suppress all output except errors.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B GHOSTLINK_CONFIG_DIR
Configuration directory (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/ghostlink)
.TP
.B GHOSTLINK_DATA_DIR
Data storage directory (default: $XDG_DATA_HOME/ghostlink)
.TP
.B GHOSTLINK_LOG_DIR
Log files directory (default: $XDG_DATA_HOME/ghostlink/logs)
.TP
.B GHOSTLINK_RUNTIME_DIR
Runtime files directory (default: $XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/ghostlink)
.TP
.B XDG_CONFIG_HOME
Base configuration directory (default: ~/.config)
.TP
.B XDG_DATA_HOME
Base data directory (default: ~/.local/share)
.TP
.B XDG_CACHE_HOME
Base cache directory (default: ~/.cache)
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.config/ghostlink/ghostlink.conf
Primary configuration file
.TP
.B ~/.local/share/ghostlink/
Data storage directory
.TP
.B ~/.local/share/ghostlink/logs/
Log files
.TP
.B ~/.cache/ghostlink/
Temporary cache files
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
Check current status:
.B ghostlink status
.TP
Add a new task:
.B ghostlink task add "Deploy new feature"
.TP
View all tasks:
.B ghostlink task list
.TP
Run diagnostics:
.B ghostlink diagnostics health
.TP
Start as daemon:
.B ghostlink daemon start
.TP
Sync with git:
.B ghostlink git sync
.SH RETURN VALUES
.TP
.B 0
Successful execution
.TP
.B 1
General error
.TP
.B 2
Command syntax error
